### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Actualizar tarifa completa (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tarifas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarifa Actualizada PUT",
  "calculation_rule": "Base",
  "base_value": 200,
  "valid_from": "2033-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "valid_until": "2033-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "status": "active"
}

### Actualizar tarifa parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/tarifas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "base_value": 250
}
